<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APAC TeleServices cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APAC TeleServices cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Fran Bernstein downgraded APAC TeleServices Inc to near-term accumulate from buy, and kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 6-1/4 to 15-1/4.</p>
<p>-- company said on Monday that it expected earnings, revenues and margins to be hurt over the balance of 1997 by costs from a large outsourcing client.</p>
</text>
